// 12-bit RGB Color Palette (4 bits per channel: R G B)
// Shared palette generated across 3 sprite sheets
// 12 unique colors extracted
FFF // Index  0: Original RGB(255,255,255) - White
CCC // Index  1: Original RGB(192,192,192) - Light Gray
888 // Index  2: Original RGB(128,128,128) - Gray
F00 // Index  3: Original RGB(255,  0,  0) - Red
000 // Index  4: Original RGB(  0,  0,  0) - Black
00F // Index  5: Original RGB(  0,  0,255) - Blue
080 // Index  6: Original RGB(  0,128,  0) - Green
008 // Index  7: Original RGB(  0,  0,128) - Navy Blue
800 // Index  8: Original RGB(128,  0,  0) - Maroon
088 // Index  9: Original RGB(  0,128,128) - Teal
FF0 // Index 10: Original RGB(255,255,  0) - Yellow
880 // Index 11: Original RGB(128,128,  0) - Olive
// Unused colours
000 // Index 12: Padded (unused)
000 // Index 13: Padded (unused)
000 // Index 14: Padded (unused)
F0F // Index 15: Transparent Key - Magenta
